# 1. Tailscale P2P 打洞与虚拟网段 (最高优先级放行，保证 NAT1 直连)
# ========================================================
PROCESS-NAME,tailscaled
PROCESS-NAME,Tailscale
DST-PORT,41641-41650
SRC-PORT,41641-41650
IP-CIDR,100.64.0.0/10,no-resolve

